<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow">Physical AI data, Japan</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="hero_h1">Know which robot training clips are worth keeping.</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="hero_p">HUMI checks first-person and robot-camera video for the problems that quietly ruin training data: darkness, blur, camera shake, hands out of frame, faces. You get a verdict for every clip, the exact moments that fail, and the sections you can still use.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn" href="#pilot" data-i18n="hero_cta">Request a pilot</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#how" data-i18n="hero_cta2">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="note" data-i18n="hero_note">Runs on your own servers. Your video never leaves your building.</p>
    </div>

    <figure class="mock" aria-label="Example report">
      <div class="mock-head"><strong data-i18n="mk_title">Batch report</strong><span>412 <span data-i18n="mk_clips">clips</span></span></div>
